  "description": "Every Prime Agent Artifact states that token emissions are permanently disabled and cannot be reverted by the Agent's own governance \u2014 then names Sky Governance's power to revert them on a Risk Capita",
  "orientation": "Every Prime Agent Artifact states that token emissions are permanently disabled and cannot be reverted by the Agent's own governance \u2014 then names Sky Governance's power to revert them on a Risk Capital breach. The guarantee is therefore strongest while the Agent is healthy and lapses exactly when holders would most want it. The design is coherent: dilution is reserved as a recapitalization instrument held by the party exposed to the Agent's failure rather than the party tempted to use it, which makes the cap credible in a way a self-imposed cap never is. It also makes Agent-token holders the designated first-loss layer.",
